    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG is delighted to present 67 Beech Hill Drive, Donnybrook, Dublin 4, to the market. This stunning and spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace home enjoys generous front and rear gardens and is ideally positioned within a quiet enclave just off Beaver Row, in the heart of sought-after Donnybrook.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and extends to approximately 105 sq. m.,(including the attic room 17 Sq. m.). The well-proportioned accommodation comprises a bright and welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, an open-plan kitchen and dining area, a comfortable lounge/sunroom, and a generous shower room.\n\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom. The first-floor landing also provides access to a large attic room, offering excellent additional space and abundant storage.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a fully enclosed rear garden with a patio area, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. To the front is a beautifully maintained, sunny garden, laid mainly in lawn and complemented by mature, planted borders. A convenient side entrance provides access to the rear garden.\n\nThis exceptional property would make an ideal family home or an attractive investment opportunity, combining generous accommodation with an enviable location. Situated just off Beaver Row, the property is within easy walking distance of Donnybrook Village, and all the amenities Dublin 4 has to offer, including a superb selection of restaurants, cafés, local shops and bars. Dublin city centre is easily accessible, while excellent public transport links provide convenient access to UCD, St Vincent's Hospital and surrounding areas. \nA wealth of recreational and sporting amenities are also close by, including Herbert Park, David Lloyd, the RDS and the Aviva Stadium.\n\nEarly viewing of this superb home is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Porch - \nSliding door to front door\n\nHallway - \nWood floor, understairs storage, plumbed for washing machine and dryer.\n\nLiving Room - \nBright reception room, wood floor, large window to front, hot press\n\nKitchen /Dining - \nWood floor, windows and door to Lounge / Sun room. Fitted presses, gas hob, electric over and extractor fan, plumbed for dishwasher, breaskfast bar with storage\n\nLounge / Sun room - \nBright reception with wood floor, two sets of double doors to rear garden. Door to shower room.\n\nShower room - \nFullt tiled floor and walls wet room, Shower head, window to rear, sky light, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - \nWood floor, window to side, stairs to attic\n\nBedroom 1 - \nBright double bedroom with wood laminate floor, window to front\n\nBedroom 2 - \nGenerous double bedroom with laminate floor, window to rear\n\nBedroom 3 - \nWood laminate floor, window to rear, built in storage press\n\nBathroom - \nTiled floor and walls, recessed lights, window to front, large shower unit, w.c., wh.b. and towel rail\n\nAttic room - \nWood floor, two Velux windows, recessed lights, eave storage\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nBeautifully maintained, sunny garden, laid mainly in lawn and complemented by mature, planted borders and Cherry tree. Side entrance provides access to the rear garden.\n\nRear Garden - \nFully enclosed rear garden with raised lawn, Pear tree and a patio area, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining\n\n"
      },
      {
